  "message": "To find the percentage decline in the allowance for doubtful accounts as of December 31, 2018, I will use the balance at the beginning of 2018 and the balance at the end of 2018 from the table. The formula for percentage decline is: (Initial Value - Final Value) / Initial Value * 100. Here, the initial value is the balance at the beginning of 2018 and the final value is the balance at the end of 2018.",
